@startuml
title Sequence - Scan (2/2): search on Spotify, rank and choose
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 115
skinparam ParticipantPadding 4
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam sequence {
  LifeLineBorderColor #888888
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FDFDFD
  ParticipantBorderColor #444444
}
autonumber
participant "Camera\nActivity" as CA
participant "Camera\nController" as CC
participant "SpotifyAlbum\nSearchService" as SS
participant "Spotify\nWeb API" as SA
participant "Album\nMatcher" as AM

CC -> CC : new Thread: searchAndRank(queries, ids, keys)
loop each Spotify album id that appeared next to the cover
  CC -> SS : getAlbumDetails(id)
  SS -> SA : GET /albums/{id} (+ /tracks pages)
  SA --> SS : album
  SS --> CC : Album
end
loop each query: at most 5 searches,\nstops after 3 if there are results
  CC -> SS : searchAlbums(query)
  SS -> SA : GET /search?type=album&limit=10&q=...
  SA --> SS : albums
  SS --> CC : List<Album>
end
CC -> CC : albums whose cover key (i.scdn.co) equals the photo's\ngo first; exactCoverMatch if there is exactly one
CC -> AM : rank(candidates, queries)
AM --> CC : candidates ordered by score
alt nothing found
  CC --> CA : onError(error_album_not_found)
else exact cover match or AlbumMatcher.isConfident()
  CC --> CA : onAlbumsRecognized([best album])
else several candidates
  CC --> CA : onAlbumsRecognized(at most 10 albums)
end
CA -> CA : runOnUiThread: showAlbumBottomSheet(albums)
[-> CA : user chooses an album
CA -> CA : openAlbumDetails(album): startActivity(AlbumActivity,\nEXTRA_SPOTIFY_ID, EXTRA_FROM_SCAN=true), finish()
@enduml
